        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]RDP Wrapper is a malware family. It is referenced in the context of the 'pebbledash' and 'appleseed' entities, with the latter linking it to the Kimsuky group. Its activity involves targeting RDP servers, as indicated by mentions of RDP server compromise and potential ransomware (decryptor) activity. An associated indicator is the hash 3211ef223177310021e174c928f96bab.[/profile]"
