        "uncertain_name": "pebbledash",
        "uncertain_mes": "Archived Content\nIn an effort to keep CISA.gov current, the archive contains outdated information that may not reflect current policy or programs.MAR-10288834-3.v1 – North Korean Trojan: PEBBLEDASH",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 7.699500340161678,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]PebbleDash, also known as pebbledash, is a North Korean Trojan attributed to the Kimsuky group. It exists in both an initial self-unpacking version and a more recent version, with associated file hashes. The malware connects to the indicator 3211ef223177310021e174c928f96bab. Its target platform is Windows.[/profile]"
    },
