            "8780e03bbbe833f797509f9ca0b3fd37eb84b63299a88723c82d9518c56bd5a7",
            "8d4b11acce641ec5b33b3fc90ec82a2fcdf2e243cb33558e16d7321488a2c70b",
            "89d4d85592bf0b5e8b55c2d62c9050bfa8c3017f9f497134dbacbb2a0f13a09e",
            "55a0bbde3e32c559715cdc9c7d30d003b9e14725a6369d30edef20c1ed6dd994",
            "2a183e571fa26a7f74943c42d3997c6b18ed133ee4b749fb1770ffadd7241f1e"
        ],
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 6.181421753281311,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]ModuleInstaller is a Windows MSI installer malware. It is used by the Lazarus Group for installation. Its technical behaviors include abusing elevation control mechanisms, compiling after delivery, boot or logon autostart execution, and access token manipulation. It targets Windows systems and has been associated with infrastructure domains such as portdedjibouti.live, aliyum.email, premier.moittpk.org, and mevron.tech.[/profile]"
    },
