            "47674b2ada8586acaf34065ff4cf788a",
            "{'MD5': 'caa640824b0e216fab86402b14447953'}"
        ],
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set, likely associated with the 'BackdoorDiplomacy' APT group (also known as Backdip, Quarian, and CloudComputating), has been linked to campaigns such as 'Lifting Zmiy'. Its infrastructure includes domains like 'https://wa.zcnewy.com' and 'http://av2wg.rt14v.com', and it is known to utilize publicly available tools for lateral movement. The group primarily targets diplomatic entities, and its activities show overlaps with other known threat actors, though its exact origin remains unattributed."
    },
