        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.808832478462572,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Win32.DOPLUGS.ZYKL.enc is a malware variant. Its key technical behaviors include data collection from removable media (T1025), replication through removable media for initial access and lateral movement (T1091), and defense evasion via hidden files and directories (T1564.001). It is associated with infrastructure including the domains estmongolia.com, iamc2c2.com, images.markplay.net, www.markplay.net, and images.kiidcloud.com. Its operations have been geographically linked to Mongolia, Malaysia, and Taiwan.[/profile]"
    },
