        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.810243115270831,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Earth Preta is a malware entity associated with the advanced persistent threat (APT) group Mustang Panda, involved in cyberespionage campaigns targeting governments worldwide via spear-phishing. It is utilized alongside malware families TONEINS, TONESHELL, and PUBLOAD in large-scale attack deployments. Its technical behaviors include establishing malicious link targets for credential harvesting and replicating through removable media for initial access. Target platforms include Windows, with observed infrastructure involving domains such as images.markplay.net, meetviberapi.com, ivibers.com, electrictulsa.com, and web.bonuscave.com, and targeting locations including Mongolia, Malaysia, and Taiwan.[/profile]"
    },
