        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set, likely the Iranian state-sponsored APT group MuddyWater (also known as MERCURY, Static Kitten, and Seedworm), employs a suite of custom malware including YCollection, GCollection, LCollection, and DWP. Its key TTPs involve deploying containers (T1610) for evasion and execution, audio capture (T1123) for collection, and spear-phishing with malicious links (T1566.002) for initial access. The group is attributed to Iran and primarily targets entities in Israel and the United States, with motivations aligned with cyber espionage and data theft.[/profile]"
    },
