        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set, likely associated with the APT group BackdoorDiplomacy (also known as BackDip, Quarian, and CloudComputating), has been observed exploiting multiple high-profile vulnerabilities including CVE-2018-0798, CVE-2022-26134, CVE-2022-30190, CVE-2023-3519, and CVE-2022-3236. Its operations show links to the known group BackdoorDiplomacy and involve the use of various publicly available tools for lateral movement. The group's specific targets and motivations are not detailed in the provided information."
    },
