        "uncertain_name": "poseidon",
        "uncertain_mes": "Poseidon is a Golang agent that compiles into Linux and macOS x64 executables. This Poseidon instance supports Mythic 3.0.0 and will be updated as necessary. It does not support Mythic 2.3 and lower.\nposeidon's icon made by Eucalyp from www.flaticon.com",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 7.699500340161678,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Poseidon is a malware entity, with aliases including Poseidon Stealer and Odyssey, and is associated with the wagemole group. Its key technical behaviors involve credential theft (T1552), dynamic command and control resolution (T1568), and data encoding for C2 traffic obfuscation (T1132). It targets macOS and Linux platforms, often delivered via malspam campaigns, and uses infrastructure like compromised domains (e.g., email.gov.in.indiangov.download) for staging (Stage Capabilities) and operations.[/profile]"
    },
