        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Cron is MITRE ATT&CK technique T1053.003, a Scheduled Task/Job sub-technique for Execution, Persistence, and Privilege Escalation on Linux, macOS, and ESXi platforms. It abuses the cron utility and crontab files (e.g., `/var/spool/cron/crontabs/root` on ESXi) to schedule malicious code execution at startup or recurring intervals. This method is distinct from remote Windows task scheduling and has been used by groups like APT38, Rocke, and APT5.[/profile]"
