        "uncertain_name": "sliver",
        "uncertain_mes": "The Cluster25 Blog\nThe Bear and The Shell: New Campaign Against Russian Opposition\nThe Bear and The Shell: New Campaign Against Russian Opposition By Cluster25 Threat Intel Team January 30, 2024 Cluster25 uncovered a newly initiated campaign likely associated with a Russian APT (Advanced Persistent Threat) group. The\nThe Duck is Hiring in Italy: DUCKTAIL Spread via Compromised LinkedIn Profiles",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 12.39787939791957,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Sliver is a Command and Control (C2) framework. Its aliases include sliver. It has been used in campaigns likely associated with a Russian APT group. Key technical behaviors include using specific C2 settings like the name 'PRETTY_BLADDER' and C&C URL 'hxxps://panda.sect[.]kr', and it employs techniques for Container and Resource Discovery, Data Manipulation, credential access from Unsecured Credentials, data collection from Information Repositories, and Network Denial of Service. Target platforms include Windows, Linux, and macOS. Associated infrastructure indicators include domains like ns1.cybertunnel.run, dnstunnel.run, and privatemake.bounceme.net.[/profile]"
    },
