        "hsage": 5.708198956472542,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Kiron is an information-stealing malware family associated with LATAM-based eCrime actors and is available for purchase on underground forums. Its key technical behaviors include automated data exfiltration and command-and-control communication using encrypted channels, data obfuscation, and data encoding. It primarily targets systems in Latin American countries, including Costa Rica, Mexico, Chile, Argentina, and Peru, and has utilized infrastructure such as the domains lovecollege.hosthampster.com, contpt.top, adjunto.pdfxml.store, massgrave.site, and the IP address 84.246.85.94:7890.[/profile]"
    },
