        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.701167637183335,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]UAC-0006 is a malware entity associated with the 'Operation Poisoned News' campaign and is linked to the threat group UAC-0020. It is delivered via malicious PDF files hosted on domains like spotcarservice.ru and cityutl.ru. Its technical behaviors include using Boot or Logon Autostart Execution (T1547) for persistence, System Binary Proxy Execution (T1218) for defense evasion, and Non-Standard Port (T1571) for command-and-control communication. The malware targets systems in Ukraine and leverages techniques like User Execution (T1204) and Supply Chain Compromise (T1195) for initial access and execution.[/profile]"
    },
