        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.7002855375922215,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Demo is a malware entity. It employs System Binary Proxy Execution (T1218) for defense evasion, User Execution (T1204) for initial compromise, and OS Credential Dumping (T1003) for credential access. Associated infrastructure includes domains like cityutl.ru and spotcarservice.ru, and IPs like 89.23.107.219 hosting files such as privat.exe and final.mp4. It has been observed targeting systems in Ukraine.[/profile]"
    },
