        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set is most likely the threat actor known as UAC-0006. It is also known as Smoky Spider and is linked to the Operation Poisoned News campaign. Its key malware includes SmokeLoader and a tool referred to as Demo. Its key TTPs involve delivering malware via malicious PDFs hosted on domains like spotcarservice.ru, using Boot or Logon Autostart Execution (T1547) for persistence, System Binary Proxy Execution for defense evasion, and leveraging phishing for initial access. The group is attributed to Russian-aligned threat actors and primarily targets Ukrainian financial and government organizations, indicating a motivation of espionage and disruption.[/profile]"
    },
