        "uncertain_related_groups": [
            "未知"
        ],
        "uncertain_name": "darktrack rat",
        "uncertain_mes": "目录\n概述 ............................................................................................................................. 3\n多种攻击手法 ............................................................................................................ 3\n攻击行动特点 ............................................................................................................ 3",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 13.34137200875145,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]DarkTrack is a Remote Access Trojan (RAT), with version 4.0 documented. Its key Tactics, Techniques, and Procedures (TTPs) include Defense Evasion through Indirect Command Execution (T1202) using utilities like Forfiles, Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion (T1497) to detect analysis environments, Masquerading (T1036) to appear legitimate, and Obfuscated Files or Information (T1027). It uses Initial Access via Phishing (T1566). Associated infrastructure includes the domain document-cdn.org.[/profile]"
    },
