        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.792051648009751,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]DarkBeatC2, also known as DarkComet or BlackShades NET, is a malware attributed to unknown groups. It employs techniques including Access Token Manipulation (T1134) for defense evasion and privilege escalation, Exfiltration Over Web Service (T1567) for data theft, and Data Encoding (T1132) for command and control obfuscation. It targets platforms such as Windows, Linux, and macOS, and has been associated with infrastructure domains like googleonlinee.com, mafateehgroup.com, and microsoft-corp.com, with observed activity targeting locations including Jordan, Saudi Arabia, Israel, and the United States.[/profile]"
    },
