        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.705888946062599,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]MuddyC2Go is a malware associated with the MuddyWater group. Its key behaviors include using cloud accounts for infrastructure, employing remote services for lateral movement, and leveraging system binary proxy execution for defense evasion. It utilizes data encoding and application layer protocols like HTTP for command and control. Its infrastructure includes domains like freeupload.store, and it has been observed targeting entities in the Central African Republic, South Africa, Israel, and the United States.[/profile]"
    },
