        "uncertain_related_groups": [
            "fin7"
        ],
        "uncertain_name": "powertrash",
        "uncertain_mes": "Rewterz Threat Alert – SideWinder APT Group aka Rattlesnake – Active IOCs",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 13.524600191241632,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Powertrash, also known as POWERTRASH, is an in-memory PowerShell dropper or loader used by the FIN7 cybercrime group. It executes embedded payloads such as CARBANAK, DICELOADER, SUPERSOFT, BEACON, and PILLOWMINT. Its technical behaviors include using Environmental Keying to constrain execution to specific target environments and employing techniques like Asynchronous Procedure Call and Portable Executable Injection for defense evasion and privilege escalation. It targets Windows platforms and has been associated with infrastructure domains like myipscanner.com, myscannappo.com, ipscannershop.com, myscannappo.online, and advanced-ip-sccanner.com.[/profile]"
    },
