        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 12.81560530838246,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]EugenLoader is a malware loader, also known as BatLoader, and is linked to groups including Apothecary Spider (Storm-1113). It is used to deploy other malware like IcedID and employs techniques such as Web Portal Capture (T1056.003) for credential theft, Phishing (T1566) for initial access, and Data Encrypted for Impact (T1486). It has been active since at least late 2022 and uses domains like cybercloudsec.com and restproxy.com for command and control.[/profile]"
    },
    "22366": {
