        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.72743344034721,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]AvNeutralizer, also known as XMRig+R77 when packed with SilentCryptoMiner, is a malware used by unknown groups. Its key technical behaviors include using Shared Modules (T1129) and Portable Executable Injection (T1055.002) for execution and evasion, and leveraging the At (T1053.002) utility for persistence. It targets Windows systems and has been distributed via indicators such as http://193.178.210.227/work_53.bin_m7.ps1 and http://45.87.154.208/icsnd3b_64refl.ps1.[/profile]"
    },
