        "uncertain_name": "logtu",
        "uncertain_mes": "Targeted attack\non industrial enterprises\nand public institutions  \n08.08.2022\nVersion 1.0  \nTARGETED ATTACK ON INDUSTRIAL ENTERPRISES\nAND PUBLIC INSTITUTIONS\n1\n© 2022 AO KASPERSKY LAB",
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 13.399643119167418,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Logtu is a malware entity with no known aliases. It is associated with the threat group TA428. Its technical behaviors include using data obfuscation (T1001) for command and control, forging Kerberos Golden Tickets for credential access (T1558.001), and conducting reconnaissance to gather victim network (T1590) and host information (T1592). Its command and control infrastructure includes domains such as www2.sdelanasnou.com, fax.internnetionfax.com, www2.defensysminck.net, www3.vpkimplus.com, and info.ntcprotek.com.[/profile]"
    },
    "22782": {
