        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.704323505916318,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]CotSam is a malware entity. It is associated with the TA428 group. Its technical behaviors involve credential access via Kerberos ticket forgery techniques like Golden Ticket (T1558.001), reconnaissance to gather victim host (T1592) and network information, and command and control using data obfuscation (T1001). Its infrastructure includes domains like server.dotomater.club, custom.songuulcomiss.com, www3.vpkimplus.com, www2.defensysminck.net, and tech.songuulcomiss.com. It is mentioned in relation to other malware like Ncctrojan and Logtu.[/profile]"
    },
