        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set is attributed to the threat group TA428, also known as Hellsing, Ice Fog, Pirate Panda, Rancor, Tick, Tonto Team, and Karma Panda. Its key malware includes nccTrojan, Logtu, Ladon, Cotx RAT, and PortDoor. The group's technical behaviors focus on credential access via Golden Ticket forgery (T1558.001) to steal Kerberos tickets, reconnaissance by gathering victim network (T1590) and host information (T1592), and command and control using data obfuscation (T1001). It targets Windows platforms and has been associated with campaigns against industrial enterprises and public institutions, showing overlaps with groups like Andariel (Silent Chollima) and potentially BackdoorDiplomacy.[/profile]"
    },
