        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 6.168306941772793,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]GhostWeaver is a malware entity. It is associated with the SparklingGoblin threat group, which is also linked to other malware families like PlugX and Plead. Its technical behaviors include performing Network Denial of Service (T1498), employing Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion (T1497), and relying on User Execution (T1204) and Phishing (T1566) for initial access and execution, specifically via malicious links (T1204.001). It targets platforms including Windows, Linux, and macOS. Its known infrastructure includes domains like opzovbjzueg.top, brcfvyjjkrckwik.top, and hbmagedlhgmakek.top, and it has been observed in Italy.[/profile]"
    },
