        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set, likely associated with the SparklingGoblin threat group, is also known as BackdoorDiplomacy, BackDip, Quarian, and CloudComputating. Its key malware includes GhostWeaver, MintsLoader, Stealc, and AsyncRAT. Its primary TTPs involve initial access through phishing and user execution via malicious links, followed by defense evasion through virtualization/sandbox detection and the use of non-standard ports for command and control. The group has been attributed to SparklingGoblin and shows overlaps with other clusters. It has been observed targeting Italy, with motivations likely aligned with espionage. Its infrastructure utilizes domains such as gizpvovur.top, poejhsjeuiwd.top, and ferujoludo.online.[/profile]"
    },
