        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]StealthVector is a malware loader. It is associated with APT41 and uses file names like wbwkem.dll, wkbem.dll, wmiwk.dll, C_20344.nls, and C_20334.nls. Its technical behaviors include abusing elevation control mechanisms, performing virtualization and sandbox evasion, capturing user input, using remote services for lateral movement, and discovering system services. It has been delivered via infrastructure including the domains track.cdn78544.ru, www.mircoupdate.https443.net, and www.sitennews.com.[/profile]"
    },
