        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.685802480650877,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]Tailscale is a legitimate remote access and networking tool that is abused by threat actors like Angry Likho as part of their tradecraft, often deployed alongside other open-source remote management tools such as ScreenConnect, AnyDesk, and RustDesk to enable and maintain remote access. Its misuse is associated with techniques like Abuse of Elevation Control Mechanism, System Service Discovery, and the use of Remote Services for lateral movement, primarily targeting Windows, Linux, and macOS platforms. Associated infrastructure includes domains like www.mircoupdate.https443.net.[/profile]"
    },
