            "8405d742405d3a6d3bda6bc49630dd5f3604a3d6ae27cbd533e425f8abbaafdc",
            "73eaba82ef1c502448e533007e92b1afa879b09f85f28b71648668ea62839ff5",
            "22a50cea6ad67a7e8582d2cd4cdc3eaaf57c0fbe8cd062a9b15710166e255a86",
            "07aa971f0791b06dd442d4c7a49c1d3d27a1cbb16602f731e870b5ef50edf69e",
            "0faddbe1713455e3fc9777ec45adf07b28e24f4c3ddca37586c2aa6b539898c0"
        ],
        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 5.68485862048591,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]StealthReacher is a malware entity. It employs TTPs including Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism (T1548) to bypass controls like Windows UAC, Virtualization/Sandbox Evasion (T1497) to detect and evade analysis environments, Input Capture (T1056) for credential theft via keystroke logging, Remote Services (T1021) for lateral movement using tools like RDP or SSH, and System Service Discovery (T1007) to enumerate services. Associated infrastructure indicators include track.cdn78544.ru, www.sitennews.com, and www.mircoupdate.https443.net, with targeting potentially involving locations like Italy and Romania.[/profile]"
    },
