        "processed": true,
        "hsage": 0.0,
        "profile_without_enhance_5": "[profile]This intrusion set, likely associated with the financially motivated group Scattered Spider (also known as UNC3944 or 0ktapus), is known for using malware families such as BlackCat ransomware, Raccoon Stealer, and RedLine Stealer. Its key tactics include establishing accounts (T1585), gathering victim organization information (T1591), and exploiting unsecured credentials (T1552). The group primarily targets sectors in the United States and the United Kingdom, with observed infrastructure including domains like telesignhr.com, rseponsequery.com, and snapchat-okta.com. Its motivation is primarily financial gain through data theft and ransomware extortion.[/profile]"
    },
